{
  "_comment": "One checklist body line rule for the Go readers (cleanup.ParseLine, cleanup.ItemsFromLines) and the editor (frontend/src/features/notes/checklist.ts parseChecklist). Both test suites read this file and assert max_depth equals their own constant (cleanup.MaxDepth, MAX_DEPTH: 0 is the top level, so 3 is four levels); the rule is stated in docs/design/checklists.md. Texts here have no extra whitespace, because the editor keeps an item's text as written while the Go readers collapse it.",
